<title>GERMANY: Puma, Wella to cooperate.</title>
<headline>Puma, Wella to cooperate.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German sportswear manufacturer Puma plans to cooperate with haircare group Wella AG's Muelhens fragrance unit to produce and market a line of body-care products, Puma said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The two groups signed a cooperation agreement and Puma said the deal would allow it to expand its traditional line of products.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
